<BaseLayout title="Explore the founding pilot" description="Tell us about your products, stock and sales channels. Kora’s founding pilot is in preparation.">
<section class="kora-container pilot-layout"><div class="pilot-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Founding merchant interest</p><h1>Your shop.<br/>Our starting point.</h1>
<p>Tell us what you sell and where orders arrive. We’re preparing a focused pilot around inventory, orders, verified payments and branded receipts.</p>
<ul class="pilot-includes"><li><span aria-hidden="true">01</span>One business and one stock location first</li><li><span aria-hidden="true">02</span>Countable products, with sizes and colours</li><li><span aria-hidden="true">03</span>Scope, timing and price agreed before access</li><li><span aria-hidden="true">04</span>No payment taken on this website</li></ul>
<p class="mt-6 text-sm">Storefronts, automatic WhatsApp messages and voice ordering follow in stages.</p></div><div class="pilot-form-panel"><p>Start with your business</p><PilotForm /></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
